  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.12: A hardening release. Security: ParseOptions.SafeMode now defaults to Safe (confines include:: to the base directory) and the safe-mode confinement bypass is fixed; :data-uri: image reads and Avalonia link-clicks are safe-mode/scheme gated; LockedAttributes is honoured through AdocParser.Parse. Robustness: guards against stack-overflow and OOM on adversarial documents (deep block nesting, huge cols repeats, callout-number overflow). Parity: fixes inline {counter:} double-increment, include indent= common-indent, cols=\"1,2a\" style letters, [stem]/++++ blocks (asciimath default), and consecutive styled description lists. Concurrency: HtmlRenderer is reentrant; DocBook/Reveal/Man and AdocEngine+extensions are concurrency-safe. Packaging: libraries (and AdocNet.Avalonia) now also target net8.0, fixing an IReadOnlySet ambiguity for .NET 8/9 consumers; AdocEngine is IDisposable. Plus the LSP resolves includes from file paths, cross-platform CLI fixes, corrected third-party font NOTICES, and many docs fixes. See CHANGELOG.md.",
